WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:05.700
Speaker 1: One of the really interesting things
we're seeing over the last week has been this

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:12.850
reversal from much of the Republican Party
about the Ukraine Russia situation.

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:18.980
And early you saw a bunch of right wingers,
including Trump, Tucker Carlson, Tulsi Gabbard,

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.130
who claims to be on the left.

00:00:20.130 --> 00:00:24.740
But we know she's not sort of defend Vladimir
Putin, and that did not go super well.

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:28.630
A lot of Republicans just weren't buying it
because it's completely implausible that we

00:00:28.630 --> 00:00:30.470
should be supporting Vladimir Putin.

00:00:30.470 --> 00:00:33.160
So now they're sort of switching to supporting
Ukraine.

00:00:33.160 --> 00:00:38.710
And one aspect of this is that now many people
who have been against Naito for a while are

00:00:38.710 --> 00:00:41.440
switching to talk about how great Naito is.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:48.790
And the sort of most notable bullet point
about this is that Donald Trump is now taking

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:54.219
credit for NATO's existence, even though for
much of his presidency, he wanted to end Naito

00:00:54.219 --> 00:00:57.300
and get the U.S. out of it and just completely
take it apart.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.399
Rolling Stone Rolling Stone's Peter Wade has
a good piece of this called the Trump who

00:01:01.399 --> 00:01:06.500
wanted to withdraw the U.S. from Naito now
claims credit for its existence.

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:10.399
There would be no Naito if I didn't act strongly
and swiftly.

00:01:10.399 --> 00:01:15.450
The former president said he put out this
statement or, you know, it was put out from

00:01:15.450 --> 00:01:18.780
by his new spokes, relatively new spokeswoman
Liz Harrington.

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:23.600
He put this out yesterday, and the statement
reads, I hope everyone is able to remember

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:24.600
that it was me.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.639
I mean, it's literally like a little kid.

00:01:26.639 --> 00:01:32.590
It was me as president of the United States
that got delinquent Naito members to start

00:01:32.590 --> 00:01:37.649
paying their dues, which amounted to hundreds
of billions of dollars.

00:01:37.649 --> 00:01:44.270
There would be no Naito if I didn't act strongly
and swiftly, which is a laughable claim.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:48.659
Naito was very strongly in existence before
Trump became president.

00:01:48.659 --> 00:01:51.159
There was no sign Naito was going away.

00:01:51.159 --> 00:01:53.520
Trump adding Also, I mean, he.

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:55.680
Trump did everything good, I guess, guys.

00:01:55.680 --> 00:02:01.950
Also, it was me that got Ukraine, the very
effective anti-tank buster javelins when the

00:02:01.950 --> 00:02:06.990
previous administration was sending blankets,
let history.

00:02:06.990 --> 00:02:13.330
So note now, of course, revisionist history
is not unusual when it comes to Donald Trump.

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:15.060
And you need only go back to an article.

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:22.040
I mean, in this case from January of 2019
from Vanity Fair by Eric Lutz, which reported

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:27.290
that Donald Trump privately discussed destroying
the Naito alliance.

00:02:27.290 --> 00:02:32.900
The president repeatedly told aides that he
wanted to withdraw the United States from

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.090
the alliance.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:40.260
The New York Times reports Trump has long
criticized Naito frequently bellyaching that

00:02:40.260 --> 00:02:45.130
the military partnership has been unfair to
the U.S. and on and on and on.

00:02:45.130 --> 00:02:51.080
However, it appears Trump's attacks on Naito
are more than bluster, citing senior administration

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:53.510
officials, the New York Times reported late
Monday.

00:02:53.510 --> 00:02:59.510
Again, this is January 2019 that at several
points in 2018, Trump discussed withdrawing

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:05.410
the U.S. from the international organization,
a move that would effectively doom the 29

00:03:05.410 --> 00:03:10.560
nation alliance and empower Russia, which
has spent years seeking to weaken it.

00:03:10.560 --> 00:03:13.210
So understand the absurdity of this.

00:03:13.210 --> 00:03:19.290
Trump now is taking credit for Naito because
Naito is so involved in supporting Ukraine

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.880
against Russia.

00:03:20.880 --> 00:03:24.970
What Trump actually was threatening and thinking
