altogether, which would have crippled it.

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:34.910
And of course, his people will praise the
flip flop as the absolute truth and say everybody

00:03:34.910 --> 00:03:36.100
else is brainwashed.

00:03:36.100 --> 00:03:41.790
If you don't accept Trump's lies now, remember
that this is a common thing that Donald Trump

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:42.790
does.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:49.670
He told people originally that the vaccine
is something he created and gets credit for

00:03:49.670 --> 00:03:50.670
it.

00:03:50.670 --> 00:03:51.670
