00:03:56.310 --> 00:03:59.440
And then his supporters didn't get the vaccine,
and then he flipped again and says, Well,

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:01.709
I get credit for it and his supporters.

00:04:01.709 --> 00:04:03.060
They do both.

00:04:03.060 --> 00:04:04.860
They they they see.

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:11.770
Or maybe they don't accept the absurd contrast
and contradiction in Trump's claims about

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:12.940
