00:04:12.940 --> 00:04:13.940
And yet they don't care.

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:17.509
They still support the guy, and it's very
similar when it comes to Naito, and it's really

00:04:17.509 --> 00:04:24.770
important to understand the degree to which
this guy is a liar and so are his followers.

00:04:24.770 --> 00:04:30.240
Not only did Trump constantly attack Naito,
