00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:57.659
Eventually, pressure became so great that
Trump did have to release that military aid,

00:04:57.659 --> 00:05:01.750
and now he wants us to believe he's always
been the big defender of Naito.

00:05:01.750 --> 00:05:05.439
And it's actually thanks to him that Naito
